WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.650
- [Narrator] Here's another quick tutorial

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.450
on how to quickly ruin your life.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.700
Step one, eliminate your goals.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.820
Don't orient yourself
towards a north star,

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.000
don't develop a vision for
what your life could be like.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.090
Doing this will make it
impossible to progress in life,

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.270
because without a goal, how do
you know you're progressing?

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.760
Eliminate any desire to get yourself

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.740
out of a suboptimal situation,

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:27.000
subscribe to the idea that
this is just the way life is,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.380
this is all I can be.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.500
It's not hopelessness,
it's self acceptance.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.090
Use loving yourself as an
excuse to spin your wheels

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.890
and mentally deteriorate.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.160
Confuse self-love with self-neglect,

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.620
wander aimlessly through life

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.810
not really knowing why you're here.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.940
Step two, stay inside.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.160
Don't expose yourself to the light,

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.200
don't be a person in the world,

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.170
stay hidden, operate in the shadows.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.930
Never subject yourself to
the judgment of others,

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.690
close yourself off from new information

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:02.070
and new perspectives,

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.650
let algorithms create deep grooves

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.990
of repeated behavior and topics.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:10.140
Catering only to your
already limited interests

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.150
until you're viewing the same things

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:15.480
and thinking the same thoughts
for the rest of your life.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.770
Allow your mind to shrink
and with it your world.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:22.170
Step three, avoid risk.

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.870
If something's risky, don't do it.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.580
You don't wanna end up like that one guy

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.400
who did that thing and lost everything,

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.450
what was his name again?

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:34.350
Assume that by avoiding
risk, you get to avoid pain,

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.230
believe that the people
who made it big in life

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.840
made obvious beneficial decisions

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.300
with little perceivable downsides,

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.820
and just wait for that
crystal clear opportunity

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.170
to come around for you.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.320
Never ask for a raise, tell a risky joke,

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.600
or stand up for what you think is right.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.190
Never apply for a job

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.380
unless you know for sure
you're gonna get it.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.700
Never ask somebody out

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.700
unless you know for certain
that they're interested.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.750
Don't put your hand up

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.730
because your question might be stupid.

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.400
Always wait for the obvious play

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.790
because it'll present
itself eventually, right?

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.890
Step four, overthink.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:14.430
Let every decision you
make no matter how minute

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:17.160
require a deep brooding think.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.100
Assume that your own logic is foolproof.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.980
Get lost in the cobwebs of your own mind,

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:25.170
divorced from external scrutiny.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.020
Develop your own personal
theories about everything

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:31.020
and never bounce these
ideas off other people,

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.550
bounce them off yourself.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.560
Step five, consume.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:37.530
Always consume more than you produce.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.590
Keep your brain entertained at all times,

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.740
not by your own creative
endeavors, obviously,

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.630
but by other people making stuff.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:49.950
Fill your mind, not with great
works of art or education,

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.450
but with content.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.120
Willingly subject
yourself to the influence

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.700
of those who encourage
further consumption.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.520
Constantly stay up to date with reviews,

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.410
rumors, comparisons.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:05.250
Motivate yourself, not
by fostering virtue,

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.440
but by accumulating objects,

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:11.130
pay your dues regularly
to remain in this cycle,

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:14.190
and if consumption becomes compulsive,

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.560
even better, now you don't
have to think about it.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.020
Step six, avoid criticism.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:22.230
Don't surround yourself with
people who keep you in check,

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.120
challenge your viewpoints,

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.280
offer differing perspectives.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:30.150
Spend time only with those
who think how you think,

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.680
act how you act.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.530
Constantly judge those
who live differently,

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.840
be quick to shut down any discussion

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.790
of matters you're convicted on,

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.890
especially ones you're emotional about.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:44.100
Let your ego blind you
from any real growth,

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.670
go through life believing
that you amazingly

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.040
have the correct viewpoint on things,

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.040
politics, religion, relationships.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.570
Never learn what it feels like

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.820
to have your belief system challenged,

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.830
because that's uncomfortable.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.930
Step seven, be secretive.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:05.130
Never expose your darker side
to anyone for any reason,

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.220
don't let anybody know about
the bad things you've done

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.050
or the things you struggle with.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.720
Let your addictions blossom in secret

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.850
where they continue to gain power.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:18.300
Develop a tendency to hold
your thoughts, actions,

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.580
and emotions close to your chest.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:24.060
Be proactive in maintaining
a facade of perfection.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:27.060
Never let anyone suspect
that you could have flaws,

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:30.690
or struggles, or any kind
of normal human weakness.

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.720
Just focus on the act,
the show must go on,

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:36.150
let what you do in the shadows stay there

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.010
rotting you from the inside.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.410
Step eight, avoid conflict.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.900
If something bothers
you, don't mention it.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.780
If someone wrongs you,
tell them it's okay,

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:46.950
we're good, bro.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:50.070
Never let your disapproval
show on the surface.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.890
Let your resentment
build slowly over time.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.560
Don't correct mistakes as they happen,

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.200
pretend not to see them, not to hear them.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.320
After all, talking about
anything uncomfortable

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.810
is just not something you wanna do.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:06.300
You don't want people to
think you're a bad person,

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.450
you're nice, and just so
easy to get along with,

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.640
at least that's what you
hope people say about you.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:15.000
Let brief disagreements
remain unaddressed.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.400
Have an elephant in every room.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.250
Let the unsaid fester and grow

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.180
evolving gradually into an
overwhelming resentment.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.830
Just try not to snap

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.320
because that makes you
look like a bad person,

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.660
because it's okay if you slowly start

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:34.650
to hate everyone around you as
long as they don't hate you.

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:36.660
Step nine, play RuneScape.

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:39.120
Step 10, be pessimistic.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.390
Always find a way to put
a negative spin on things,

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:45.060
like a demon on your
shoulder convincing you

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:47.730
that things are worse
than they actually are.

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:51.030
Complain compulsively that
you have to go to work,

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.650
instead of that you get to,

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:56.010
lament about all these
things you have to do

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.500
as if you're a child being sent to bed.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.750
Get so used to complaining

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.520
that you can no longer recognize

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.590
when something good happens to you.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.060
Everything is bad,

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.470
everything sucks,

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.410
cling zealously to
narratives that weaken you

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.850
rather than build you up.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:14.850
Believe that nothing you
ever do will end up working

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.040
because you're playing a losing game,

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.930
that no habit you try to implement

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.900
will ever stick because
they never have before.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:24.360
Defeat yourself before you even start,

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.760
be the demon on your own shoulder,

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.030
reflect only on the
negative aspects of yourself

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.100
until they're all you can see.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.370
Swaddle yourself in the
despair of inaction,

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.250
convince yourself that
that's somehow less painful

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.540
than action.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.880
So, if you're generally pretty happy

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.210
and you want things to just
seem a little less bright,

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:48.120
then you're in luck, because
if you follow this advice,

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:50.270
you'll probably ruin
the rest of your life.

